# SRG SRG-APP-000380-WSR-000072: The web server application, libraries, and configuration fil
# STIG ID: V-206427 (MEDIUM)
# Check: Web server file permissions

META
    esp_id `web-srg-srg-app-000380-wsr-000072-app-file-perms-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `web-server`
    criticality `high`

    title `SRG SRG-APP-000380-WSR-000072: The web server application, libraries, and configuration files must only be acce`
    description `The web server application, libraries, and configuration files must only be accessible to privileged users.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `web-server,srg,disa-stig,permissions,internal`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:SRG-APP-000380-WSR-000072,NIST-800-53:CM-5(1)(A)`
    control_objective `CM-5(1)(A)`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `WebServer:localhost:web-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA Web Server SRG guidance for SRG-APP-000380-WSR-000072.`

    component_id `comp-web-server`

    impl_CM_5_1_A `This control is validated by probing the web server configuration or network endpoint against the DISA Web Server SRG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        path `/etc/nginx`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE perms_check
        exists boolean = true
        permissions string = `0644`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_metadata
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF perms_check
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
